# Local developer credentials. One-time setup:
# - copy this file to .env.secrets (drop the .example)
# - ask a team member for the values and fill in the blanks below
# - keep advancing health equity!
#
# .env.secrets is gitignored. Never commit it or paste a key into a PR,
# issue, or chat log.
#
# Every name below is left blank on purpose: a blank reads as "not
# configured" to the scripts, so an un-filled copy fails with setup
# instructions instead of sending a placeholder to a real API.

# readme.io, for scripts/readme_recipes/sync_recipes.py:
README_API_KEY=
